ss=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Forged\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/Lumite_Forged.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20240302092114\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/Lumite_Forged.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20240302092114 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/Lumite_Forged.png/revision/latest?cb=20240302092114 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Forged\" width=\"270\" height=\"206\" data-image-key=\"Lumite Forged.png\" data-image-name=\"Lumite Forged.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">River Cave, Finlay, Ferwater, Acid Wastes</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">Ore</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">?$/studs</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$165/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$270/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.51.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n<b>Lumite</b> is a vibrant, fluorescent green <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Ores\" title=\"Category:Ores\">ore</a></b> found in <a href=\"/wiki/Prismarine\" title=\"Prismarine\"><b>Prismarine</b> <b>nodes</b></a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\"><b>caves of the River Biome</b></a>.\n</p><p>Raw <b>Lumite</b> can be sold for <b>Lumite Credits</b> in the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\"><b>River Shop</b></a> at a rate of <b>1 piece</b> for <b>1 credit</b>. These <b>credits</b> can be used to buy various <b>items</b> that aid in harvesting more <b>Lumite</b>. There is no minimum size requirement for exchanging Raw <b>Lumite</b> into <b>credits</b>. \n</p><p>To mine <b>Lumite</b>, you need a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Pickaxe\" title=\"Refined Pickaxe\">refined pickaxe</a></b> or greater. <a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Refinery\" title=\"Industrial Refinery\"><b>Industrial Refineries</b></a> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Forge\" title=\"Industrial Forge\">Industrial Forges</a></b> are required to process it.   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Lumite</b> used to <b>not</b> be exchanged for <b>credits</b> in <b>small</b> or <b>chiseled</b> pieces.</li>\n<li><b>Lumite</b> can <b>not</b> be exchanged for <b>credits</b> in its <b>forged</b> or <b>refined</b> variant.</li>\n<li><b>Lumite</b> needs to be refined and forged by <b><a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Refinery\" title=\"Industrial Refinery\">Industrial Refinery</a></b> and <a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Forge\" title=\"Industrial Forge\"><b>Industrial Forge</b></a></li>\n<li><b>Lumite</b> used to have a sell value of <b>$570</b>, making it one of the best ores to farm in-game.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Ore_Nav\" title=\"Template:Ore Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Ore_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d